name defoldfonts
category Package
revision 68234
shortdesc Define old font commands
relocated 1
longdesc In 1994, with LaTeX2e, the old font commands \rm, \sf, \tt,
longdesc \bf, \it, \sl, and \sc became obsolete. This package defines
longdesc them, and also the deprecated KOMA-Script command \sfb.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/defoldfonts/defoldfonts.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/komascript/defoldfonts/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/komascript/defoldfonts
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/komascript/defoldfonts.git
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/defoldfonts
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font-supp
catalogue-version 1.0
